	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} hopped in the motor.\r{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} tryna\nlearn {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\rBut {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} can’t learn\nmore than four moves.\rDelete a move to make\nroom for {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Give up on learnin’\n{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} ain’t learn\n{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} popped out the motor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} finna get\nforgotten. That cool? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} Poof!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} forgot how to\nuse {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\rAnd...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned\n{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which ROTOM you pickin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Egg can’t get in a motor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That homie can’t get in a motor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} hopped in the motor.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} popped out the motor.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Turn which ROTOM back to its\nregular form? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh? ROTOM look like it wanna\ngo back to its regular form.\rYou wanna pull it outta\nthe motor? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00014" index="14">
