	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There was a appliance here.\nThe one with the weird motor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a microwave.\nIt got a weird motor on it.\rSomebody been cookin’ in here...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a microwave.\nIt got a weird motor on it.\rOh? ROTOM look like it wanna\nhop in the motor.\rLet it get in the motor? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROTOM sadly gave up on gettin’\nin the microwave’s motor...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00023" index="23">
