	<row id="msg_0538_T11R0702_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a mysterious notebook here.\nCan’t tell how old it is.\r“I got the info on ROTOM by pure\nluck. Finders keepers.\r“ROTOM can hop in and merge\nwith special motors. Wild.\r“Turns out ROTOM can stay\nin a motor basically forever.\r“But it pop out if it go in a\nUnion Room or a Wi-Fi Club.\r“ROTOM also pop out the motor\nif it get left at the Day Care.\r“ROTOM might forget some moves\nwhen it leave a motor.\r“This homie need\nMAD observation and analysis.\r“So I get ALL the credit,\nmy ROTOM research stay secret.\r“They gon’ worship me as the\nscientific GOAT Char...”\rThe rest of the notebook is blank.</language>
	</row>
